{"id":"msg_m_ex_elegg_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_elegg","label":"Elegg · Nikke"},"label":"2. Mr. Commander.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_elegg_01","next":"msg_m_ex_elegg_03","speakers":{"elegg":"Elegg"},"icons":{"elegg":"si_c500_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_1","text":"Mr. Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_2","text":"Mr. Coommaanndeerr!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_3","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_4","text":"Are you good at sorting things, Mr. Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_5","text":"Yes, I'm great at it.","jump":"m_ex_elegg_02_7"},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_6","text":"No, not really.","jump":"m_ex_elegg_02_11"},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_7","text":"Oh, that's a surprise!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_8","text":"How so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_9","text":"I seem to recall your room always being a mess.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_10","text":"Unless that's just how you organize things?","jump":"m_ex_elegg_02_13"},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_11","text":"Same here!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_12","text":"Hehehe.","jump":"m_ex_elegg_02_13"},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_13","text":"Why do you ask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_14","text":"Oh, um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_15","text":"I just came back from an inspection at the Power Station.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_16","text":"That place never ceases to amaze me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_17","text":"All the wires","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_18","text":"are sorted so nicely!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_19","text":"They're even divided up according to category!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_20","text":"Isn't that amazing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_21","text":"... Is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_22","text":"Of course, it is!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_23","text":"You've been to our institute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_24","text":"Over there,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_25","text":"wires are hanging from the ceiling like cobwebs.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_26","text":"They're also strewn about the floor,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_27","text":"so they're always hanging on my arm,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_28","text":"or I end up kicking them with my feet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_29","text":"Why don't you sort them out?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_30","text":"I've tried to. Several times, in fact.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_31","text":"The weird thing is that after a day or two,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_32","text":"they go straight back to the way they were.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_33","text":"So, I figured","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_34","text":"I could learn some tips and tricks on how to organize things from you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_35","text":"I guess I was wrong.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_36","text":"Isn't Maxwell responsible for arranging the wiring at the Power Station?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_37","text":"I think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_38","text":"Oh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_39","text":"Right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_40","text":"Oops, my bad, Mr. Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_41","text":"I guess I should've gone straight to Maxwell instead!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_42","text":"Hehehehehehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_43","text":"I'll go talk to her now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_02_44","text":"Thanks, Mr. Commander!","jump":null}],"chat":true}